'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page one of the [[Democratic Detonation Premium Warbond#Page 1|Democratic Detonation]] Premium [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|18|notext}} and 12 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Engineering Kit}}

==Trivia==
''Fallout'' fans have speculated whether the helmet's inspiration came from the [https://fallout.wiki/wiki/NCR_Ranger_Helmet NCR Rangers;] while the similarities are notable, we'd have to consider [[Helldivers 1:Armor#Hazard Ops|Mk-9 Hazard Ops]]… although one does not preclude the other.

